==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[flash]] [[drive]]}}
# A small [[electronic]] device used to store [[digital]] [[data]], more [[portable]] and [[robust]] than a [[hard drive]], ranging in capacities from 64MB to 256GB.

====Synonyms====
* [[data stick]]
* [[USB]] flash drive
* [[jump drive]]
* [[thumb drive]]
* [[pen drive]]

